<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Re Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Re Corp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded General Re Corp to strong buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- General Re gained 1-3/8 to 162-7/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
